    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Sync Odoo Tags with the EVICore database\n### This node will update [Odoo Contacts](https://odoo.edvistas.com/web?debug=1#menu_id=111&action=139) which have the EVI District value present in the 'EVI_DistID' field.\n##### This info is found on the [Odoo contacts](https://odoo.edvistas.com/web?debug=1#menu_id=111&action=139) under the 'Integration' tab.  The following fields will be updated:\nTags, EVI District Name, EVI Last Sync, EVI Last Login, Student Info System, State District ID.\n##### Tags contain product names that a specific district have activated in [EVICore](https://apps.edvistas.com).\n\n**This is a **Sync** operation so it will add and remove remove tags from odoo that match [EVICore](https://apps.edvistas.com).",
